<title>MEXICO: Mexico's TIIE 28-day rate falls to 31.9250 pct.</title>
<headline>Mexico's TIIE 28-day rate falls to 31.9250 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's 28-day interbank interest rate fell by 41.50 basis points to 31.9250 percent on Tuesday, from 32.3400 percent on Monday, Banco de Mexico said.</p>
<p>THE TIIP fell 84.72 basis points to 31.9021 percent on Tuesday from 32.7493 percent the week before.</p>
<p>The TIIE is a market-weighted average interbank rate that is replacing the TIIP, an average interbank rate.</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newsroom 525 7289558</p>
</text>
